
flowchart TB
    Owner[Owner Dashboard]
    Portal[Client Portal]

    API[Backend API]
    DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    Storage[(Private S3-Compatible Object Storage)]
    Queue[Queue Worker]
    Mail[Email Provider]

    Owner -->|HTTPS: session + CSRF| API
    Portal -->|HTTPS: magic link in URL path| API

    API -->|Users, requests, items,<br/>sessions and file metadata| DB
    API -->|Upload and delete file contents| Storage

    API -->|Queue account email jobs| DB
    DB -->|Fetch queued jobs| Queue
    Queue -->|Send account emails| Mail

    API -->|Progress and signed download URLs| Owner
    API -->|Request status and upload results| Portal
    Owner -->|Download file via signed URL| Storage
